From b89176ddc7926d322790ee582b5775a6b5941d2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aryan Kadole <aryan.kadole@espressif.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:21:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add usrsctp_snap_prepare(): the INIT chunk for an
 out-of-band exchange

For SNAP (draft-uberti-tsvwg-warp, section 4.1) on one-to-one AF_CONN
sockets: the association is set up as by usrsctp_connect(), but its INIT
chunk is returned instead of sent and no INIT timer runs. The chunk is
built once, so asking again returns the same bytes.
